        "nobel_worthiness": "Jamming supplied a powerful universal framework for rigidity, disorder, and collective arrest in systems far from equilibrium.",
        "attribution": "Liu and Nagel crystallized the jamming scenario and its cross-disciplinary physical significance.",
        "maturity": "It has generated a mature theoretical and experimental literature spanning granular matter, foams, emulsions, and amorphous solids.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Whether jamming is sufficiently sharply universal across its many applications remains debated."
